      "MITZI: The living room, I guess.\nBENNIE: Hey, sorry I’m late, I picked up Mrs. Fabelman. Where should I put her?\nHADASSAH: Otpusti menya, kayzol, tebe shto, nyeh stiidno?!\nBENNIE: OWWWW!!!! OW OW OW!",
      "MITZI: It’s on the table.\nHADASSAH: Cossack.\nHADASSAH: This is brisket?",
      "BENNIE: And deep down inside you, Mrs. Fabelman, admit it: I’m your friend too.\nHADASSAH: Deep down inside of me is none of your business.\nMITZI: Sid Caesar’s on at 8! Help me.",
